{"about_the_game":"<strong>The Warrior is a short action/adventure platformer where protagonist, story and mechanics are constantly changing. Control legendary warriors, giant worms, greedy kings and lazy demons, each with their own purpose.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Control multiple characters</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/multiple_about.gif?t=1747062266\" /><br>Each character wants to be the protagonist of their own adventure. You will be put in the shoes of each one and discover that the distinction between the story's villain and hero is merely a matter of perspective.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve puzzles</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/puzzle_about.gif?t=1747062266\" /><br>In addition to different skills, each character faces unique difficulties and challenges. Overcoming them requires thinking outside the box.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/explore_about.gif?t=1747062266\" /><br>The world is filled with details and secrets. Take the opportunity to explore, encounter new creatures, and decipher ancient runes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight colossal bosses</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/fight_about.gif?t=1747062266\" /><br>In the depths, unimaginably colossal and terrifying creatures await. Overcoming them is no easy task.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover the truth</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/truth_about.gif?t=1747062266\" /><br>You can piece together the story through dialogue and ancient buildings from the perspective of each character. Can you unc